# Lessons

Recurring patterns and mistakes to avoid on this codebase. **Review at session start.**

Append a new entry whenever you're corrected on something that will recur. Keep the
format below so entries stay skimmable and greppable. Newest at the top is fine.

Entry format:

```
## <short, specific title>
**Context**: where/when this came up.
**Problem**: what went wrong.
**Rule**: the durable rule that prevents it next time.
**Applies to**: the paths or areas this governs.
```

